// ReGS extension of metro/scripts/system.script (used as installed; see VM::extendSource). The game pauses while its
// window is out of focus when $settings.$stopWithoutFocus is on, which the original reads once, as the script loads.
// Port (owner's request 2026-11-24): the setting has a checkbox on the graphics page and applies at once. The base's
// focus handlers are always made (the setting is on while it loads); the engine passes the window's focus changes to
// them only while the setting is on (engine/input.cpp), and the return of focus always after a pause it caused.
$regsStopWithoutFocus = MAIN.$settings.$stopWithoutFocus : true;
MAIN.$settings.$stopWithoutFocus = true;
//@base
MAIN.$settings.$stopWithoutFocus = $regsStopWithoutFocus;
